- Print DebugPrint/log messages to the EE console on PS2
- Try KOUMAKYO_xx.DAT/.dat when the Japanese-named data files cannot be opened
- Report failures to open data files instead of continuing silently
- Boot flash (dark blue) and first-frame logs in the GS backend
- Do not crash if log.txt cannot be created

